sequenceDiagram
    title DSD — CU-154 Consultar Listado De Franjas Horarias
autonumber
participant CTRL as TimeSlotController
participant SRV as TimeSlotService
participant TREP as RepositoryTimeSlot

CTRL->>SRV: findAll(distributorId)
activate SRV
SRV->>TREP: find(where distributor_id)
activate TREP
TREP-->>SRV: TimeSlot[]
deactivate TREP
SRV-->>CTRL: TimeSlot[]
deactivate SRV
CTRL->>CTRL: TimeSlotMapper.toDto(timeSlot) por cada franja
